message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Birds from Captions: A Diffusion Transformer Trained from Scratch on CUB-200-2011"
abstract: >-
  A text-to-image system comparing a 55.6M-parameter diffusion transformer
  trained from scratch with a rectified flow objective against a LoRA
  fine-tune of Stable Diffusion 1.5, over a shared latent space, trained
  entirely on a single 8 GB laptop GPU.
